        508.81536865234375,
        234.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "Yes. People have mentioned that the furniture from Peak Rentals is more\nmodern than any of the other companies. And also, once you place an order,\nthe furniture will be delivered to you in just one or two days.\n"
    },
